Third-party notice / 第三方说明

host.js is derived from better-dsh-session-deletetool 0.5.3
(https://github.com/Lzcdebear/better-dsh-session-deletetool),
Copyright (c) Lzcdebear, released under the MIT License.

The delete engine it carries — artifact removal, descendant family gathering,
the running-work admission gate, workspace and projection-cache cleanup, and
the bulk (/catalog, /delete-batch) routes — is that project's work. This
package renames the routes to /dsh-codex-session-deletetool/* and drives them
from the Codex UI service entry point instead of the sidebar menu slot.

host.js 改编自 better-dsh-session-deletetool 0.5.3
（https://github.com/Lzcdebear/better-dsh-session-deletetool，作者 Lzcdebear，
MIT 许可）。其中的删除引擎——删除产物目录、收集后代家族、运行中工作准入、
工作区与投影缓存清理，以及批量（/catalog、/delete-batch）路由——来自该项目。
本包将其路由改名为 /dsh-codex-session-deletetool/*，并把入口从侧边栏菜单插槽
换成 Codex UI 的服务调用。
